    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "I can't walk anymore...",
      "_offset": 2903,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "All right then, let's find a place\nto rest!",
      "_offset": 2927,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "There! There's a normal building!\nThere's gotta be people there!",
      "_offset": 2971,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "No one would live in a forest like\nthis.",
      "_offset": 3036,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "I'm sure they're there! Let's go!",
      "_offset": 3077,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Hey, Joe! Wait up...",
      "_offset": 3111,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Excuse me, is anyone here?",
      "_offset": 3132,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "A building, here of all places...",
      "_offset": 3159,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "There's a pretty picture!",
      "_offset": 3193,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "You're right! But why's there a\npicture of an angel?",
      "_offset": 3219,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "There can't be any bad Digimon in\na place with a picture of a pretty\nangel!",
      "_offset": 3272,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "I guess it can't be helped.",
      "_offset": 3348,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Let's take a good look around this\nplace.",
      "_offset": 3376,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "I smell food...and it's a feast!",
      "_offset": 3418,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "I smell food...and it's a feast!",
      "_offset": 3451,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "I smell food...and it's a feast!",
      "_offset": 3484,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Whaaaaat?!",
      "_offset": 3517,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "There!",
      "_offset": 3528,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "You're right! A whole feast right\nhere...",
      "_offset": 3539,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "No matter how you look at it, it's\na bit too good to be true.",
      "_offset": 3581,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "It's delicious!",
      "_offset": 3643,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "It's like some sin, eatin'\ndelicious food like this!",
      "_offset": 3659,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "I'll eat some, too! I'd like to be\nlucky, just once in a while!",
      "_offset": 3712,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Me too!",
      "_offset": 3776,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Me too!",
      "_offset": 3784,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Me too!",
      "_offset": 3792,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Me too!",
      "_offset": 3800,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Let's eaaaaat!",
      "_offset": 3808,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Let's eaaaaat!",
      "_offset": 3823,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "And Tai and his friends stuffed\nthemselves.",
      "_offset": 3838,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "I ate so much!",
      "_offset": 3885,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "My stomach's so full, I don't\nthink I can eat any more...",
      "_offset": 3900,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "It feels like camping school!",
      "_offset": 3958,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "We were *supposed* to be at summer\ncamp, but then...",
      "_offset": 3988,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "but then...",
      "_offset": 4041,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "but then...",
      "_offset": 4053,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Yeah, we left home thinking we'd\nbe going to summer camp.",
      "_offset": 4069,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "we left home",
      "_offset": 4127,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "we left home",
      "_offset": 4140,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "We've been lost in this world for\nfive days. The school and town\nassociation must be in an uproar.",
      "_offset": 4157,
      "_length": 98,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "We're all worried about home. I\nam, too...",
      "_offset": 4256,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "We have to hang in there for now!",
      "_offset": 4299,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "We'll think about it tomorrow!",
      "_offset": 4333,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Don't complain about it, Sora. For\nnow, we have to hang in there!",
      "_offset": 4364,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "You're right, but...*sigh*",
      "_offset": 4430,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Sora...",
      "_offset": 4457,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Let's sleep for now and think\nabout it tomorrow!",
      "_offset": 4465,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Haha, that's just like you,\nTai!",
      "_offset": 4514,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Is that a good thing?",
      "_offset": 4550,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Of course it is!",
      "_offset": 4572,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "It's around bedtime. Aren't we all\ntired?",
      "_offset": 4589,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "We'll all be able to go home,\nright...?",
      "_offset": 4631,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Papa...Mama...",
      "_offset": 4671,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "I wanna go home...",
      "_offset": 4686,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Crying won't do anything.",
      "_offset": 4705,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Even Matt can be discouraged...",
      "_offset": 4731,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Crying won't do anything. Cheer up!",
      "_offset": 4765,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Waaaaaaaaaah! Aaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 4801,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Oops, I messed up.",
      "_offset": 4825,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Even Matt gets discouraged\nsometimes, but he tries hard not\nto show it!",
      "_offset": 4844,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Even Matt?",
      "_offset": 4918,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Yeah. So if you want to help him,\nthen smile for his sake!",
      "_offset": 4931,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Okay...",
      "_offset": 4990,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Everyone gets discouraged once in\na while, so I'll give it my all!",
      "_offset": 4998,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "I didn't want to get everyone\ndepressed, but...",
      "_offset": 5065,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "(It's gotten late...)",
      "_offset": 5113,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Talk some more with everyone else",
      "_offset": 5135,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Turn in for the night",
      "_offset": 5169,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Let's call it a day!",
      "_offset": 5191,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "I'm kinda sleepy.",
      "_offset": 5212,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Okay then, good night!",
      "_offset": 5230,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "They're sleeping. They fell into\nthis trap so easily.",
      "_offset": 5253,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "I'll crush 'em while they sleep!",
      "_offset": 5307,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Kill...the children!",
      "_offset": 5340,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Hahahaha...!",
      "_offset": 5361,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Hey...Tai, are you awake?",
      "_offset": 5374,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Mmmf...Agumon, what's wrong?",
      "_offset": 5403,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "What's wrong? Say it straight.",
      "_offset": 5436,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "P-O-O-P! I gotta use the bathroom.",
      "_offset": 5467,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Got it, got it! Can't be helped.",
      "_offset": 5502,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "*yawn* Let's hurry up, find the\nbathroom, and go back to bed.",
      "_offset": 5535,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Tai! I said the bathroom!",
      "_offset": 5597,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Ahaha, looks like I'm still\nsleepy.",
      "_offset": 5626,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Ugh! I can't hold it in much\nlonger!",
      "_offset": 5662,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Tai! That's the dining room!",
      "_offset": 5699,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Ahaha...I don't know why, but my\nstomach still feels empty.",
      "_offset": 5731,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Ugh! I can't hold it in much\nlonger!",
      "_offset": 5791,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Why don't you just go to the\nbathroom by yourself?",
      "_offset": 5828,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "I'm sure even *you're* too scared\nto go to the bathroom at night.",
      "_offset": 5879,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Don't be silly! I'm a\nfifth-grader.",
      "_offset": 5945,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "What's a fifth grader? Tai, you\nuse too many hard words.",
      "_offset": 5981,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Right, you don't have schools\nhere.",
      "_offset": 6041,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Ah! Tai, did you just hear\nsomething?",
      "_offset": 6077,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Huh? No, nothing out of the\nordinary.",
      "_offset": 6118,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "I thought I heard someone\nwhispering over there, but...",
      "_offset": 6156,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Come on, it must be your\nimagination.",
      "_offset": 6212,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "But I'm sure I heard a voice.",
      "_offset": 6250,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "You're scared to go to the\nbathroom, now you're saying there\nare ghosts...",
      "_offset": 6280,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "They exist! Ghost Digimon exist!",
      "_offset": 6355,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Those aren't ghosts, those are\nDigimon!",
      "_offset": 6388,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Good, just in time! Don't go back\nby yourself, okay Tai?",
      "_offset": 6428,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Okay, I'll wait outside.",
      "_offset": 6488,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "It's weird, I ate so much, so I\nthought there'd be a lot.",
      "_offset": 6513,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "I can't do anything but fart.",
      "_offset": 6571,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Ughhaaaah! I can't take it\nanymore!",
      "_offset": 6601,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaack!",
      "_offset": 6637,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "What's wrong?! Did something\nhappen?",
      "_offset": 6649,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "That stinks! That reaaaaaaally\nstinks! You...",
      "_offset": 6686,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "It's Ogremon!",
      "_offset": 6732,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Run!",
      "_offset": 6746,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "We have to hurry up and get back\nto the others!",
      "_offset": 6751,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Kill...the children!",
      "_offset": 6799,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "L-Leomon!",
      "_offset": 6820,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "It would have been better if you'd\njust slept quietly.",
      "_offset": 6830,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "It's Devimon! He's the strongest,\nmost evil Digimon!",
      "_offset": 6885,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
